  "expected_temporal_order": 2,
  "expected_spatial_order": 3,
  "ordering_note": "PPM achieves O(h^3) on smooth profiles (CW84 limiter inactive). Temporal order is O(dt^2) from the Lin-Rood Strang-like correction (Lin & Rood 1996 §4). Limiter-active regions degrade to O(h) in space.",
  "imperative_reference": "src/operators/transport_2d.jl::transport_2d_linrood! at pinned ref 35cc9143dc553ac7d3619738bd77b250c1ed162f (see docs/content/rfcs/array-discretization-parity.md for parity contract). Coverage today lives at test/test_transport_2d.jl."
